{"annotations":[],"blockId":"bixiu-xia","blockTitle":"必修下","body":"选自《临川先生文集》卷三十七（《王安石全集》第5 册，复旦大学出版社2016 年版）。桂枝香，词牌名。\n\n桂枝香·金陵怀古\n\n王安石\n\n登临送目[1]，正故国[2]晚秋，天气初肃[3]。\n\n千里澄江似练，翠峰如簇[4]。\n\n归帆去棹残阳里，背西风，酒旗斜矗。\n\n彩舟云淡，星河[5]鹭起，画图难足[6]。\n\n念往昔，繁华竞逐[7]，叹门外楼头[8]，悲恨相续[9]。\n\n千古凭高[10]对此，谩嗟荣辱[11]。\n\n六朝旧事随流水，但寒烟衰草凝绿。\n\n至今商女，时时犹唱，后庭遗曲[12]。\n\n这首词是王安石在金陵写的登高怀古之作。上片先点明登临时节，随后写眼前景色。澄江似练，夕阳翠峰，酒旗招展，白鹭翔舞，确是一幅优美的图画。下片感叹六朝竞逐奢靡繁华而相继灭亡，只剩下寒烟衰草；继而陈说空叹兴亡荣辱其实没有意义，奋起变革，有所作为，才可以避免重蹈覆辙。张炎在《词源·意趣》中说这首词“清空中有意趣”。反复诵读，说说这种“意趣”是什么。","contentVersion":"yw-3e77f0f7ffa5d042a6d06763","createdAt":"2024-08-22T14:36:37Z","derivedAuthor":"王安石","derivedFrom":"lesson-1755","excerpt":"选自《临川先生文集》卷三十七（《王安石全集》第5 册，复旦大学出版社2016 年版）。桂枝香，词牌名。 \n桂枝香·金陵怀古\n王安石 \n登临送目 [1] ，正故国 [2] 晚秋，天气初肃 [3] 。\n千里澄江似练，翠峰如簇 [4] 。\n归帆去棹残阳里，背西风，酒旗斜矗。\n彩舟云淡，星河 [5] 鹭起，画图难足 [6] 。\n念往昔，繁华竞逐 [7] ，叹门外楼头 [8] ，悲恨相续 [9] 。\n千古凭高 [10] 对此，谩嗟荣辱 [11] 。\n六朝旧事随流水，但寒烟衰草凝绿。\n至今商女，时时犹唱，后庭遗曲 [12] 。\n这首词是王安石在金陵写的登高怀古之作。上片先点明登临时节，随后写眼前景色。澄江似练，夕阳翠峰，酒旗招展，白鹭翔舞，确是一幅优美的图画。下片感叹六朝竞逐奢靡繁华而相继灭亡，只剩下寒烟衰草；继而陈说空叹兴亡荣辱其实没有意义，奋起变革，有所作为，才可以避免重蹈覆辙。张炎在《词源·意趣》中说这首词“清空中有意趣”。反复诵读，说说这种“意趣”是什么。","forumImages":[],"forumUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/t/topic/1755","id":"lesson-1755-p2","learningTasks":[],"postCount":1,"posts":[{"attachments":[],"created_at":"2024-08-22T14:37:42Z","id":"11209-2","images":[],"like_count":0,"links":[{"classes":"anchor","has_image":false,"href":"#p-11209-h-1","text":"#p-11209-h-1","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11209-1","text":"[1]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11209-2","text":"[2]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11209-3","text":"[3]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11209-4","text":"[4]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11209-5","text":"[5]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11209-6","text":"[6]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11209-7","text":"[7]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11209-8","text":"[8]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11209-9","text":"[9]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11209-10","text":"[10]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11209-11","text":"[11]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11209-12","text":"[12]","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11209-1","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11209-2","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11209-3","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11209-4","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11209-5","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11209-6","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11209-7","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11209-8","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11209-9","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11209-10","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11209-11","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11209-12","text":"↩︎","title":""}],"plainText":"选自《临川先生文集》卷三十七（《王安石全集》第5 册，复旦大学出版社2016 年版）。桂枝香，词牌名。 \n桂枝香·金陵怀古\n王安石 \n登临送目 [1] ，正故国 [2] 晚秋，天气初肃 [3] 。\n千里澄江似练，翠峰如簇 [4] 。\n归帆去棹残阳里，背西风，酒旗斜矗。\n彩舟云淡，星河 [5] 鹭起，画图难足 [6] 。\n念往昔，繁华竞逐 [7] ，叹门外楼头 [8] ，悲恨相续 [9] 。\n千古凭高 [10] 对此，谩嗟荣辱 [11] 。\n六朝旧事随流水，但寒烟衰草凝绿。\n至今商女，时时犹唱，后庭遗曲 [12] 。\n这首词是王安石在金陵写的登高怀古之作。上片先点明登临时节，随后写眼前景色。澄江似练，夕阳翠峰，酒旗招展，白鹭翔舞，确是一幅优美的图画。下片感叹六朝竞逐奢靡繁华而相继灭亡，只剩下寒烟衰草；继而陈说空叹兴亡荣辱其实没有意义，奋起变革，有所作为，才可以避免重蹈覆辙。张炎在《词源·意趣》中说这首词“清空中有意趣”。反复诵读，说说这种“意趣”是什么。","post_number":1,"reply_to_post_number":null,"updated_at":"2024-08-22T14:37:42Z"}],"readerDocument":{"curationManifestSha256":"98e90b3603b34b437bc554810c21f01c4db44d10364211af114d30fde3d67bad","curationVersion":"2026-07-30.2","lessonId":"lesson-1755-p2","main":{"annotations":[{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"登临送目，登山临水，放眼远眺。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11209-1"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"故国，故都，这里指金陵。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11209-2"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"肃，肃爽，天高气爽。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11209-3"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"翠峰如簇，聚集在一起的山峰。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11209-4"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"星河，天河，这里指长江。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11209-5"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"画图难足，图画难以完备地展现。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11209-6"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"繁华竞逐，争相追逐奢侈豪华生活。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11209-7"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"门外楼头，语出唐杜牧《台城曲》：“门外韩擒虎，楼头张丽华。”","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11209-8"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"悲恨相续，指各个王朝接连覆亡。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11209-9"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"凭高，登临高处。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11209-10"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"谩嗟荣辱，枉自感叹兴亡的荣耀和耻辱。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11209-11"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"至今商女，时时犹唱，后庭遗曲，语出唐杜牧《泊秦淮》：“商女不知亡国恨，隔江犹唱后庭花。”","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11209-12"}],"blocks":[{"level":2,"runs":[{"text":"桂枝香·金陵怀古","type":"text"}],"type":"heading"},{"runs":[{"text":"王安石","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"登临送目","type":"text"},{"label":"[1]","noteId":"footnote-11209-1","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，正故国","type":"text"},{"label":"[2]","noteId":"footnote-11209-2","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"晚秋，天气初肃","type":"text"},{"label":"[3]","noteId":"footnote-11209-3","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。\n\n千里澄江似练，翠峰如簇","type":"text"},{"label":"[4]","noteId":"footnote-11209-4","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。\n\n归帆去棹残阳里，背西风，酒旗斜矗。\n\n彩舟云淡，星河","type":"text"},{"label":"[5]","noteId":"footnote-11209-5","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"鹭起，画图难足","type":"text"},{"label":"[6]","noteId":"footnote-11209-6","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"念往昔，繁华竞逐","type":"text"},{"label":"[7]","noteId":"footnote-11209-7","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，叹门外楼头","type":"text"},{"label":"[8]","noteId":"footnote-11209-8","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，悲恨相续","type":"text"},{"label":"[9]","noteId":"footnote-11209-9","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。\n\n千古凭高","type":"text"},{"label":"[10]","noteId":"footnote-11209-10","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"对此，谩嗟荣辱","type":"text"},{"label":"[11]","noteId":"footnote-11209-11","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。\n\n六朝旧事随流水，但寒烟衰草凝绿。\n\n至今商女，时时犹唱，后庭遗曲","type":"text"},{"label":"[12]","noteId":"footnote-11209-12","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"这首词是王安石在金陵写的登高怀古之作。上片先点明登临时节，随后写眼前景色。澄江似练，夕阳翠峰，酒旗招展，白鹭翔舞，确是一幅优美的图画。下片感叹六朝竞逐奢靡繁华而相继灭亡，只剩下寒烟衰草；继而陈说空叹兴亡荣辱其实没有意义，奋起变革，有所作为，才可以避免重蹈覆辙。张炎在《词源·意趣》中说这首词“清空中有意趣”。反复诵读，说说这种“意趣”是什么。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"frontMatter":[{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"选自《临川先生文集》卷三十七（《王安石全集》第5 册，复旦大学出版社2016 年版）。桂枝香，词牌名。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"}],"guidance":[],"links":[],"media":[],"sourceOnlyBlocks":[],"sourcePostId":"11209-2","sourcePostNumber":1},"mediaReceiptLedgerSha256":"5487243dd8d14d65dfadc20ed544a999aaa318fc20c291462ea62c69e1eff320","mediaReceiptLedgerVersion":"2026-07-30.2","provenance":{"links":[{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#p-11209-h-1","postId":"11209-2","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#p-11209-h-1","text":"#p-11209-h-1","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11209-1","postId":"11209-2","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11209-1","text":"[1]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11209-2","postId":"11209-2","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11209-2","text":"[2]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11209-3","postId":"11209-2","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11209-3","text":"[3]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11209-4","postId":"11209-2","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11209-4","text":"[4]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11209-5","postId":"11209-2","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11209-5","text":"[5]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11209-6","postId":"11209-2","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11209-6","text":"[6]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11209-7","postId":"11209-2","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11209-7","text":"[7]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11209-8","postId":"11209-2","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11209-8","text":"[8]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11209-9","postId":"11209-2","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11209-9","text":"[9]","title":null},{"disposition":"i